        "reason-1": {
          "type": "reason",
          "settings": {
            "category": "THE GAP",
            "title": "Requirements don’t scale down with your appetite",
            "content": "<p>You’re eating a lot less. Portions shrink, meals get skipped without you ever deciding to skip them. But your body still runs on the same vitamins and minerals it ran on before — that list doesn’t get shorter because you’re less hungry. Less food on the plate means less of everything that used to come with it.</p>"
          }
        },
        "reason-2": {
          "type": "reason",
          "settings": {
            "category": "FORMAT",
            "title": "Six capsules is a hard ask when you have no appetite",
            "content": "<p>The usual answer to eating less is a handful of capsules. That’s exactly the thing that gets harder when you’re not hungry: more to swallow, on an almost empty stomach, with a glass of water you don’t particularly want either. GOMU is 8 gummies you chew. No water, no capsules, no negotiating with yourself at 8am.</p>"
          }
        },
        "reason-3": {
          "type": "reason",
          "settings": {
            "category": "DENSITY",
            "title": "You don’t need more food. You need what you take in to carry more.",
            "content": "<p>Adding volume isn’t an option — appetite doesn’t work that way. So the only lever left is density: 15–20 actives at clinically documented doses, in something the size of a snack. Vitamins, key minerals, adaptogens, prebiotic fiber. One daily pack asks you for 30 seconds, not for a bigger meal.</p>"
          }
        },
        "reason-4": {
          "type": "reason",
          "settings": {
            "category": "BIOAVAILABILITY",
            "title": "Forms your body can actually use",
            "content": "<p>Zinc bisglycinate instead of oxide. L-5-MTHF instead of folic acid. Methylcobalamin, and a complete B complex. These forms are chosen for absorption — which counts for more, not less, once the total volume you take in has dropped. What you don’t absorb never counted in the first place.</p>"
          }
        },
        "reason-5": {
          "type": "reason",
          "settings": {
            "category": "FIBER",
            "title": "Prebiotic fiber, because fiber is one of the first things to go",
            "content": "<p>When you eat less, fiber usually falls along with everything else — and most people were already well short of it on a normal day. GOMU includes prebiotic fiber in every daily pack. It isn’t a laxative and it doesn’t treat anything. It’s simply the fiber that used to arrive with the food you’re no longer eating.</p>"
          }
        },
        "reason-6": {
          "type": "reason",
          "settings": {
            "category": "SIMPLICITY",
            "title": "30 seconds. One pack. Nothing to measure.",
            "content": "<p>Tear the pack, chew 8 gummies, done. 28 packs per pouch — four weeks, already portioned for you. Strawberry raspberry, fruit pectin base, no gelatin. On the days when food is the last thing you want to think about, this is the part of the routine that still happens.</p>"
          }
        }
