          "settings": {
            "question": "There’s ashwagandha in it. Who should avoid it?",
            "answer": "<p>Ashwagandha KSM-66 is not recommended during pregnancy or breastfeeding, for anyone under 18, or for people with a liver or thyroid condition (ANSES guidance). If any of that applies to you, or if you’re not sure, talk to your doctor before you start.</p>"
          }
        },
